/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 31 0 R
/E (Welcome to The Aqua-Epoch! Global water quality is facing critical challenges due to pollution and climate change. Modern sensor networks collect large amounts of chemical and physical water data, but much of it remains uninterpreted. In this challenge, your goal is to analyze water quality data, build smart machine learning models to determine whether water is safe to drink, and develop a user-friendly web application for real-time predictions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [28]
>>
